Cell["\<\
A directed edge is never the same as an unordered one, so a and au are not \
isomorphic:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"114e3e9e-994a-364b-822b-7ad3115ac138"],

Cell["IsomorphicHypergraphQ[a, au]", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"02a3acd1-77cc-1e46-95ef-af935d6a351c"],

Cell[BoxData["False"], "Output",ExpressionUUID->"199e571d-92de-2c42-9621-35efd206fd58"],

Cell["Labels count only up to renaming", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"fdce6bd3-5a75-ba48-afc9-9390791fa74e"],

Cell["\<\
The two hypergraphs below are the same directed path, one carrying edge \
labels a and b, the other x and y. They are isomorphic: on top of the vertex \
renaming sits the label correspondence a \[Rule] x, b \[Rule] y.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1e47a069-74ca-9d47-a8d1-2cb71c0af9eb"],

Cell["\<\
h1 = Hypergraph[{Edge[{1, 2}, \"Directed\", \"a\"], Edge[{2, 3}, \
\"Directed\", \"b\"]}];
h2 = Hypergraph[{Edge[{4, 5}, \"Directed\", \"x\"], Edge[{5, 6}, \
\"Directed\", \"y\"]}];
{h1, h2}\
\>", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"064489d1-a121-2143-a7d6-c934580f4614"],

